(32471, '14', '2', '1', '64', 'I hope that you are well! I have received the following feedback from the client, let me know if anything is unclear:\r\n\r\nFront Page Overview\r\n\r\nPlease can what forms to complete text be updated to the wording provided underneath the snip: \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWhat forms to complete:\r\n\r\nClick the link above and select the appropriate option to kick off the payroll set-up process for a new client i.e. Existing Payroll or New Payroll.\r\n\r\nIf you have it, you can also upload the software backup directly to us via this form.\r\n\r\nSetup Charges:\r\n\r\nUp to 9 employees there is a £16.50 + VAT setup charge.\r\n\r\n610 or more employees setup is Free Of Charge.\r\n\r\nIf you require us to retrieve the handover information from the client/previous provider (including requesting starter information from clients) there is a £45.00 + VAT charge (this is inclusive of the £16.50 setup fee).\r\n\r\nPAYE Scheme registration £45.00 + VAT\r\n\r\nPension Setup (Penfold/Smart) £70.00 + VAT\r\n\r\nPension Setup (Other) £150.00 +VAT\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEmployment Allowance\r\n\r\nCan you please add these descriptions somehow to each of the below as small text:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCan this client claim Employment Allowance?\r\n\r\nInfo: This is the initial point of assessment. It indicates whether the client is eligible to claim the allowance.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWhat is the status of the Employment Allowance claim for this tax year?\r\n\r\nInfo: These are specific to each tax year and indicate the client\'s eligibility status for that particular year. As circumstances can change from one tax year to another, this reflect the client\'s eligibility status for this tax year.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCompany Details\r\n\r\nCompany drop down not working\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPension Details\r\n\r\nPension in place drop down doesn’t work so I couldn’t select it:\r\n\r\nPension provider & \'who’s portal\' dropdown not working\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThanks,', NULL, '2024-07-31 07:09:59', '2024-07-31 07:30:07', '2024-07-31', '00:20:08', NULL, NULL),
