(39607, '14', '2', '2', 'o1', 'Integrating Map API with Location Attribute: Connect the location field to a map API (such as Google Maps API) to allow users to select the desired address. This will be used for fields like the departure and destination locations.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nListing Quotes by Category: Vendors should receive notifications when quotes matching their selected \'region\' and \'category\' are listed. The quotes should be filtered based on region and category. Vendors will be able to view quotes by selecting their region (e.g., Sydney, Melbourne) and the type of service (e.g., airport transfer, general transfer, etc.).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSaving Booking to Calendar and Notifications: Once a booking is completed, it should be saved to a calendar, and a notification should be sent one day before the booking date.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNotification Feature: Implement a feature to send a booking reminder to users one day before their reservation. This notification should be sent via email or KakaoTalk. Use the KakaoTalk API to send notifications regarding bookings and quotes to KakaoTalk. KakaoTalk notifications should be automatically sent to both users and vendors for reservations and key updates.\r\n\r\nok, there are 4 steps. so , could you process them?', NULL, '2024-10-10 05:32:01', '2024-10-10 06:35:55', '2024-10-10', '01:03:54', NULL, NULL),
