(40013, '14', '2', '2', 'o1', 'I hope you had a great day. he s more clarity, I am a realtor who works through eXp Realty. KVcore is their proprietary CRM. All realtors who work with eXp realty are given a website from eXp that is connected to KVcore. It already has the IDX tools. The website that they provide their realtors is customizable. Have you ever worked with KVcore? I assume that we can mesh the social media site that you can build with the eXp website. The file that I am sharing is meant to provide clarity to avoid misunderstandings regarding the digital tools on the social media site. Keep in mind that the file was created before I realized that I could use the website from eXp that I already have and that already has the IDX functionality.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTo answer your questions:\r\nAre there any specific functionalities you’d like to see from social media platforms that you want to replicate here? I can\'t think of anything else. Keep in mind that I want to be cautious not to allow people to start drama like people do on social media often. For this reason, I would prefer to have drop-down choices to replace comments where required.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n1. For the personal directory, how much information would you like residents to share: Name, address, phone number email Instagram FB. However, they are free to put only what they are comfortable with.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n2. Do you have a preferred design or branding that reflects the community’s aesthetic? I made a logo that I will attach. I can create a video of the entrance to the community that is pretty.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n3. Would you prefer immediate alerts via email, SMS, or push notifications for the lost animal feature? all 3 I think. What is your advice?', NULL, '2024-10-15 06:25:10', '2024-10-15 07:32:25', '2024-10-15', '01:07:15', NULL, NULL),
