(43950, '9', '2', '2', '166', 'For the Global Leader site, we would like to add a new client which is called Abbey School.\r\n\r\nTo confirm, this will be a new category of products, that can only be seen by certain users. EG if a user is logged in as an Abbey School user, they should only be able to see Abbey School products.\r\n\r\nI believe that at the moment, there is just one tab of products for logged in users for NKC College and so it would be good to discuss the exact steps that we will need to take to change this back to allow the different product categories to be shown to different users depending on their reference number.\r\n\r\nWould you be able to confirm the cost for getting this added as well as a rough turnaround time?', NULL, '2024-11-20 05:56:54', '2024-11-20 06:07:31', '2024-11-20', '00:10:37', NULL, NULL),
