(44879, '2', '2', '2', 'o1', 'Deploy our Existing cPanel based Laravel App to Laravel Vapor\r\n\r\nSpecialized profiles can help you better highlight your expertise when submitting proposals to jobs like these. Create a specialized profile.\r\n\r\nWe are currently using cPanel / WHM for hosting our Laravel App, and everytime when we have to deploy it for a client, we need a separate cpanel access but now we want to shift / convert our app towards serverless environment.\r\n\r\nWe found that Laravel Vapor is a good solution, we can directly connect our app with Vapor via add API\'s for AWS and deploy in serverless environment. We want someone who already worked on it, and help us to deploy our product in Vapor and so we can test and scale on that,\r\n\r\nOnly if you have good skill set on Laravel Vapor then apply', NULL, '2024-11-28 05:33:25', '2024-11-28 05:54:48', '2024-11-28', '00:21:23', NULL, NULL),
