(46394, '14', '2', '2', 'o1', 'We\'re looking for an experienced digital marketing specialist with a strong background in SEO and RSS feed integration to guide the development of an AI-driven news website. The ideal candidate should have a vision for building and ranking a niche blog, leveraging AI-generated content and SEO strategies.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n➡️ Provide SEO best practices and strategies to improve search engine rankings\r\n➡️ Guide the integration and optimization of RSS feeds for content aggregation\r\n➡️ Help create and refine a content strategy that utilizes AI-generated articles\r\n➡️ Ensure the website structure is optimized for search engine visibility\r\n➡️ Focus on content marketing and optimization to drive organic traffic\r\n\r\nRequired Skills and Experience:\r\n\r\n➡️ Proven experience ranking websites, particularly news or content aggregation platforms\r\n➡️ Strong understanding of SEO techniques and how to implement them effectively\r\n➡️ Experience with RSS feed integration and optimization\r\n➡️ Familiarity with AI content generation tools and natural language processing\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional Information:\r\nYou will work closely with our team to ensure the website ranks effectively and attracts targeted traffic. We’re looking for someone with expertise in SEO and content strategy who can help guide us in building a niche blog that leverages AI and RSS feeds.\r\n\r\nApplication Steps:\r\n\r\n1️⃣ Provide two examples LINKS of websites you\'ve ranked, including the THE RANKING POSITION AND KEWORDS.  Please give these details.\r\n\r\n2️⃣ Share your vision for building a successful blog based on RSS feeds, SEO optimization, and AI-generated content. How would you ensure this site ranks and drives traffic?\r\n\r\n3️⃣ Confirm your availability to work on this project for at least 3-4 hours a day.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to talk to you about this potentially long term project.', NULL, '2024-12-11 07:12:02', '2024-12-11 07:33:41', 