(69651, '2', '2', '2', '293', 'Thanks for getting back to me! I’d like you to help with two final tasks:\r\n1. Marketplace Job Cards:\r\n• Make the hourly pay field fully dynamic on all job cards and ensure it shows up correctly when new jobs are posted.\r\n• Confirm the card pulls the value from _zf_salary_display.\r\n• Test by posting a job to ensure it’s working.\r\n2. Loop Grid:\r\n• Update the Marketplace grid to use Elementor’s Loop Grid for job cards (instead of static cards).\r\n• Make sure the hourly pay also shows on the single job detail page.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI’ve already purchased Elementor Pro, so all the tools you need are active. Once this is done, I’ll close out this contract.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know your ETA to complete this.', NULL, '2025-09-12 11:38:58', '2025-09-12 13:25:29', '2025-09-12', '01:46:30', NULL, NULL),
