(70396, '7', '2', '3', '299', 'Here are some small bits of feedback:\r\n \r\n• After the consultant complete each stage of their profile, for example everything before training that when they complete training for example, is it possible for the page to refresh because there’s no message to the Consultant, they need to refresh for them to then upload files\r\n \r\n• For the map, the information that needs to be shown on the pop up when someone clicks is just job title country code and then if a view profile link.\r\n \r\n• When someone clicks on the profile, they should only see the job title, job description, country code, and then the profile text the admin but no other information.\r\n \r\n• I have just created a profile and the pin is showing up near Africa but it should be within the United Kingdom. I’m not sure if it’s something that I did wrong :)\r\n \r\n• Lastly, for the PDF in the back end, I think we’re going to need two PDFs one exactly how it is at the moment which is the CIF form, but then I think we need another PDF which shows their full profile once I’ve completed all of the different sections we can just add the different sections at the bottom of the PDF settings like training, qualifications and societies.\r\n \r\nLet me know if you have any questions and thanks again!', NULL, '2025-09-22 09:59:05', '2025-09-22 10:44:07', '2025-09-22', '00:45:02', NULL, NULL),
