(89628, '2', '2', '2', 'o1', 'Kashyap \r\nI need an independent WordPress developer to give sherwoodpizza.ca a solid tune-up from back end to checkout. Security comes first: please audit every theme, plugin, and core file, remove anything suspicious, and harden the site so we stop seeing warning flags from hosts or browsers. Once the house is clean, I want the online ordering flow polished. Customers should be able to place an order, watch its status update in real time, and get clear confirmation on screen and by email or text. If you see quick wins to streamline the journey or add thoughtful custom options, note them in your proposal. Payments are the other missing piece. Today we offer only the basics. I want to accept major credit cards plus Apple Pay and Google Pay—Stripe is fine, but suggest any restaurant-friendly gateway you prefer after reviewing the current setup. Ongoing site management matters too. Frequent menu and promo changes mean the CMS must stay easy for staff to update, the interface needs a fresh coat of paint that matches our brand, and load times have to stay crisp at dinner rush. Solid on-page SEO (schema, keyword tuning, alt text, etc.) should be baked in from the start so we rank for local searches right away. Deliverables • Full security audit and cleanup with documented fixes • Improved order tracking module deployed and tested on desktop & mobile • Payment integration for credit cards, Apple Pay, and Google Pay with sandbox and live tests • UX refresh covering content updates, performance tuning, and design tweaks • Basic SEO optimisation and a short hand-off guide so my team can maintain it Restaurant website experience is a big plus—let me know which projects in your portfolio are closest to ours, how long you’ll need, and any plugin licences we should budget for.', NULL, '2026-03-12 04:56:17', '2026-03-12 07:32:19', '2026-03-12', '02:36:02', NULL, NULL),
